---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Research - Dasher">
  <h1>Research</h1>

  <p>
    Dasher is built on decades of research from the Inference Group at the University of Cambridge,
    led by David MacKay. The project has been documented in numerous academic publications,
    presentations, and press coverage.
  </p>

  <div class="research-grid">
    <a href="/docs/research/publications/" class="research-card">
      <h2>Publications</h2>
      <p>Academic papers published in peer-reviewed venues including Nature, UIST, and CHI.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/research/presentations/" class="research-card">
      <h2>Presentations</h2>
      <p>Talks, demos, and conference presentations about Dasher.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/docs/research/press/" class="research-card">
      <h2>Press Coverage</h2>
      <p>Media mentions and articles about Dasher in popular publications.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>

<style>
  .research-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .research-card {
    display: block;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-white);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-deep-ink);
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .research-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-target-coral);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .research-card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .research-card p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
</style>
